        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "71018694-c110-532e-ad17-ab3c31ea978c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Liz Rose, Taylor Swift, Pat McLaughlin, Gary Allan, Jessica Alba, Kathy Bates, Jessica Biel, Bradley Cooper, Eric Dane, Patrick Dempsey, Héctor Elizondo, Jamie Foxx, Jennifer Garner, Topher Grace, Anne Hathaway, Ashton Kutcher, Queen Latifah, Taylor Lautner, George Lopez, Shirley MacLaine, Emma Roberts, Julia Roberts, Carter Jenkins\n- Songs: \"Teardrops on My Guitar\", \"White Horse\", \"You Belong with Me\", \"Songs About Rain\"\n- Companies: Big Machine Records\n- Albums: Swift's eponymous debut album\n- Films: Valentine's Day (2010 film)\n- Awards: Grammy Award\n\nFacts:\n- \"Teardrops on My Guitar\" was released on February 19, 2007, by Big Machine Records as the second single from Taylor Swift's eponymous debut album from 2006.\n- Liz Rose co-wrote \"Songs About Rain\" with Pat McLaughlin, and Gary Allan recorded the song.\n- In 2010, Liz Rose and Taylor Swift won a Grammy Award for \"You Belong with Me\".\n- Liz Rose has co-written twenty of Taylor Swift's officially released songs and singles, including \"White Horse\", \"Teardrops on My Guitar\", and \"You Belong with Me\".\n- Valentine's Day (2010 film) features an ensemble cast led by Jessica Alba, Kathy Bates, Jessica Biel, Bradley Cooper, Eric Dane, Patrick Dempsey, Héctor Elizondo, Jamie Foxx, Jennifer Garner, Topher Grace, Anne Hathaway, Ashton Kutcher, Queen Latifah, Taylor Lautner, George Lopez, Shirley MacLaine, Emma Roberts, Julia Roberts, Carter Jenkins, and Taylor Swift.\n- Taylor Swift made her film debut in Valentine's Day (2010 film).",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "fcec4ad1-e04d-5889-86b1-4c429d2dadea",
        "text": "Page: Liz Rose. Sentence: She has co-written twenty of Swift's officially-released songs and singles, including \"White Horse,\" \"Teardrops on My Guitar,\" and \"You Belong with Me,\" which won her and Swift a Grammy Award in 2010.\nPage: Teardrops on My Guitar. Sentence: \"Teardrops on My Guitar\" was released on February 19, 2007 by Big Machine Records, as the second single from Swift's eponymous debut album (2006).\nPage: Songs About Rain. Sentence: \"Songs About Rain\" is a song written by Pat McLaughlin and Liz Rose, and recorded by American country music artist Gary Allan.\nPage: Valentine's Day (2010 film). Sentence: The film consists of an ensemble cast led by Jessica Alba, Kathy Bates, Jessica Biel, Bradley Cooper, Eric Dane, Patrick Dempsey, Héctor Elizondo, Jamie Foxx, Jennifer Garner, Topher Grace, Anne Hathaway, Ashton Kutcher, Queen Latifah, Taylor Lautner, George Lopez, Shirley MacLaine, Emma Roberts, Julia Roberts, Carter Jenkins, and Taylor Swift in her film debut.",
